{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778050/extras/Demeter.gif?t=1750255589\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mythmatch has all the joy of a merge game without any ads or microtransactions. Instead, we have a variety of gameplay and an anti-capitalist story about standing up against the gods of Olympus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Family to Un-Find</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778050/extras/Dialog.gif?t=1750255589\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Artemis was born to be a Goddess, but even amongst immortals, the gatekeeping runs deep. Use the spite to fuel you and show them what you're made of.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Help the Mortals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778050/extras/Building_Upgrade_V3.gif?t=1750255589\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thrown down from Olympus, work with the mortals to\u00a0resources, craft materials, and build a new Ithaca that works for them. Gain Belief, power up, and take the fight back to Olympus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Challenge the Gods</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While you\u2019re fixing up the mortal realm, you\u2019ll be tearing things down in Olympus. Prove your worth as you face the challenges from the gods.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Win, and you could earn their favour. Can you convince them to show grace to the mortals? Or are you all better off without them?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1778050?t=1750255589","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778050/621a726a06a3ab65faedc5cbce6e52d7d3dece42/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750255589","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778050/22e61d39c3058f90ba96d47ce1b4f94f9030e6c8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750255589","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778050/22e61d39c3058f90ba96d47ce1b4f94f9030e6c8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750255589","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2490290,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778050/extras/Demeter.gif?t=1750255589\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mythmatch has all the joy of a merge game without any ads or microtransactions. Instead, we have a variety of gameplay and an anti-capitalist story about standing up against the gods of Olympus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Family to Un-Find</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778050/extras/Dialog.gif?t=1750255589\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Artemis was born to be a Goddess, but even amongst immortals, the gatekeeping runs deep. Use the spite to fuel you and show them what you're made of.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Help the Mortals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778050/extras/Building_Upgrade_V3.gif?t=1750255589\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thrown down from Olympus, work with the mortals to\u00a0resources, craft materials, and build a new Ithaca that works for them. Gain Belief, power up, and take the fight back to Olympus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Challenge the Gods</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While you\u2019re fixing up the mortal realm, you\u2019ll be tearing things down in Olympus. Prove your worth as you face the challenges from the gods.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Win, and you could earn their favour. Can you convince them to show grace to the mortals? Or are you all better off without them?</p>","developers":["Team Artichoke"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778050/346f2395f7d26390408ce21cd5457f6bbae3c6cf/header.jpg?t=1750255589","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OS X 10.11 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core M<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OS X 10.11 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core M<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257121835,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257121835/movie480.mp4?t=1744645465","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257121835/movie_max.mp4?t=1744645465"},"name":"Mortal Realm Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257121835/cad9d1bf573a75665da42d2f2964ecdb81ba73e5/movie_600